\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par We are in need of patience,\cf0 
\par When sorrow comes our way.
\par When trials and temptations
\par Could cause our heart to stray.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Come ye selected fold,
\par Where death can never hurt you
\par and patience not desert you
\par this truth you shall uphold.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  A godly gift is patience,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 fruit of the Holy Ghost.
\par He gives if for our keeping
\par to hold and cherish most.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This worthy, honoured guest
\par relieves from care and worry
\par and helps us bear and carry
\par the burdens  of unrest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Our faith is born thro' patience
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 that holds fast to God's word
\par Guard that it be not stolen,
\par secure and undeterr'd.
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Faith is a solid wall
\par where patience lies protected
\par and where God's own elected
\par need fear not that they fall.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. For patience I am longing
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 my heart of this can tell.
\par My search was lone and ardent,
\par my God knows that full well.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord of grace and love,
\par grant Thous this plea I tender,
\par I pray Thee Thou will render
\par much patience from above.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  My dearest Saviour, my God,
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 give me all that patience!
\par In you alone I find peace
\par my faith is built on you.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In pain I perturb not;
\par and after all my trials
\par I'll take my rest in your home,
\par an everlasting joy.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

